{"1980710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vladimere's Lhore", "steam_appid": 1980710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3294350], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vladimere's Lhore is a collection of games including 14 games from said developer, spanning a wide variety of genres. Including; Stalker Horror, 3D Platformer, Combat Flight Sim, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a museum full of facts about each game and developers commentary hiding within them where Vladimere Lhore talks about their thought process : </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>KILLDEATH</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;When a mortal coil begins to fail, the only recourse is to KILLDEATH itself and gain immortality.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980710/extras/KILLDEATH.PNG?t=1770133841\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Atari 2600 style Action game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expected Play Time : 10-15 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Death before the clock runs out. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Demons for a precious few extra seconds. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>No Strings Attached</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A night of noodles and canoodles is cut short by a demon from the past.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980710/extras/No_Strings_Attached.PNG?t=1770133841\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An 8-bit Stalker Horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expected Play Time : 45-90 minutes  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the secrets of the estate. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try not to get caught. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Hellenore</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hellenore is looking to get out of the house when her friend Haru asks for help.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980710/extras/Hellenore.PNG?t=1770133841\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute 3D Platformer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expected Play Time : 30-60 minutes  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Levels to explore. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Nightmare Killer</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;A dream that feels a little too real.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980710/extras/15b118953f58cf9d908a265c74a94b62.avif?t=1770133841\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A PS1 style Comedy Horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expected Play Time : 5-10 minutes  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Hallways. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read Notes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Out run the Killer. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the Nightmare. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>KILLDEATH Again</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;When a mortal coil begins to fail, the only recourse is to kill Death itself and gain immortality.... again&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980710/extras/500b956908a2b58a0fc1186880f5328d.avif?t=1770133841\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A PS1 style ARPG.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expected Play Time : 15-30 minutes  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Death before the clock runs out.... Again </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Upgrades. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slay swarms of Husks with the Harvester Flame. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Become Prey</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Barbara Jones recalls the reasons why she doesn't camp alone anymore.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980710/extras/8dbb629b9b792f38d7d9cc2dc620324c.avif?t=1770133841\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A PS1 style Natural Horror game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expected Play Time : 10-20 minutes  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the woods. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid becoming prey. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Become Prey 2</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Barbara Jones fights for her life as old trauma rears its ugly head.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980710/extras/0b0684c29e66d6f8664ac4b0203b4897.avif?t=1770133841\" width=500 height=250 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A PS1 style Action Horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expected Play Time : 60-90 minutes  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight coyotes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gems. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade rifle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Levels. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>What A Wonderful Life</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Remember the past in a sea of memories.&quot;