p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an eerie facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So many ways to die!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A 10 year anniversary collection including 14 short games by Vladimere Lhore, plus a museum.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980710/9fd459769615a091c2af3e6ffe9ac472986380bc/header.jpg?t=1770133841", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980710/5829fecaf7cd279dd4a415ea2b0fb728b816bb48/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770133841", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1980710/5829fecaf7cd279dd4a415ea2b0fb728b816bb48/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770133841", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> SSE2 instruction set support.<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX10 (shader model 4.0) capabilities<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Steam OS<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 150 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}